{
  "_about": [
    "Judged query set for ./do search-eval. Relevance is NOT judged by any search system: each query carries a spec over the product's STRUCTURED attributes, and src/search_eval/relevance.py grades every product in the catalogue against it (exhaustive, not pooled).",
    "Grade 2 = pet + category + refinement all satisfied. Grade 1 = pet/category satisfied but the refinement is not (only when the query HAS a pet or category constraint). Grade 0 otherwise.",
    "Strata test different things on purpose: exact and brand should favour lexical search; synonym, paraphrase, misspelling and Nordic are where semantic search should earn its place. A vector arm beating lexical on `exact` is a harness smell, not a win.",
    "refine keys: dietary | brand | token_any (a list; the product name must contain at least one, case-insensitive).",
    "Food categories are dry-food + wet-food; treats are treats + dental-treats. Only dogs have dental-treats in this catalogue."
  ],
